# EPB Layered Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  subgraph clients [Clients]
    Web[Web_App]
    Mobile[Mobile_App]
    API_Client[API_Client]
  end

  subgraph presentation [Presentation_Layer]
    FE[Frontend]
  end

  subgraph edge [Edge_Layer]
    BFF[Backend_For_Frontend]
  end

  subgraph platform [Platform_Services]
    Auth[Authentication]
    Notif[Notification]
    Sched[Scheduler]
